    semantics (Classical/Continuous Planning), the verified SAT planner STRIPS theories, the
    propositional-logic library, and assorted HOL-Library theories. Contains no project-local
    theories, so it can be built once and loaded in jEdit as a stable heap while the editable
    Tree_Decomp_Grounding_Common theories are developed on top.\<close>
